WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.680
LIKE FATHER LIKE DAUGHTER

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.280
Come on!

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:53.680
Come on, Papa, keep going.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:58.840
It takes more than a fall and a snowstorm
to stop an Iop and his favorite daughter.

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:13.760
But the snowstorm, it's trying
its hardest. It won't get us, though.

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:18.120
I promise, I'm going to find us
a cozy place to take shelter.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:21.640
Hold on, Papa.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:25.360
Just hold on a bit longer.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:35.800
Elely!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:42.040
Stop with this nonsense
and show yourself!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.720
Come on.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:50.920
I promise I won't hurt you.

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:20.800
Papa!

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:22.960
I thought you were dead.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:26.600
I mean, only for a minute.
I know that nothing can kill you.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.800
And... Eva?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:35.000
Mama and Flopin were taken by Adamai
and the fat Pandawa is catching us up.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.720
I... I'll take care of him.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:45.240
You're all beat up, Papa,
you can't even stand up.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.680
-I've got this.
-You... You're too little.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:53.040
"An Iop is never too young
for a good fight."

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.120
Just don't forget to use your head.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.200
That's the first thing you taught me!

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:27.480
Come on, little girl, stop hiding!
A great destiny awaits you!

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:29.960
Yeah, and a good beating awaits you!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.560
Once I'm done with you, tell me
where my mom and brother are.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:38.120
Young ones...

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:49.560
You should rest, little sister.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:53.680
No, I'd rather stay here with him.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:59.440
Father might remain in this state
for months and we have a kingdom to rule.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.440
Can't you have the decency to wait
before thinking about ruling?

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:07.440
I'm thinking of our people. Someone
must be there to make decisions.

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:10.680
Isn't it just perfect
that someone is you, Armand?

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:15.160
-You've been waiting for your moment.
-I've spent my life preparing for this.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:18.480
But when will you start
behaving like a queen?

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:22.000
So you're still fighting,
even at my bedside?

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.000
Sorry, Father.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:28.800
Armand is right, Amalia.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:31.920
You can't spend your days at my bedside.

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:38.360
Huh! I hate these darn portals.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.680
Yugo!

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:42.480
-Amalia, there's an emergency...
-Shame on you!

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:46.000
Yugo the Eliatrope, you think
you can go wherever you like,

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.480
This is the Sadida king's bedroom!

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:51.240
Our father, the beloved king, is sick!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:54.600
What right do you have
to burst in here uninvited?

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.040
Sorry. I didn't realize.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.800
That's enough, Armand!

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:02.960
Yugo has saved the Sadida Kingdom
several times.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.720
-He is one of us.
-Father!

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:12.520
What has happened to you, Yugo?
You look quite distraught.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.840
It's Adamai. He...

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:18.240
He's back and he attacked Dally,
Eva and the kids.

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:21.880
I'm scared Dally is no longer with us.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.880
No longer with us?

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:29.000
That's impossible! You're talking about
your brother and our best friend.

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:31.840
I saw it all, Amalia.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.200
We need to go and check.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.440
I can't go right now.
I need to stay with Father.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:40.840
Oh, no, you don't!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:43.840
As king, I order you
to go and help your friends.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:49.680
It's time the Sadida Kingdom paid
its debt to the Brotherhood of the Tofu.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:05.840
Come to my room, Yugo,
and explain the situation.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.200
Get well soon, Your Highness.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.680
It looks like I'll get
a break from all the arguing.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.240
Come on, little girl.
You can't be serious.

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:35.040
You're not really going to fight me,
are you?

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.800
You know, I'm the child of a god, too.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:41.000
We should join forces, not fight.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:45.600
You should have started with that
before you destroyed our house.

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:49.920
Well, maybe we got off on the wrong foot,
but it did save us some time.

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:53.840
And we have big plans
for you and your brother.

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:58.000
It's not up to you to decide what we do.
That's what our parents are for.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:03.800
I see. As stubborn as an Iop. You won't
come without a good spanking, I get it.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:07.080
It'll take more than a spanking,
fat furball!

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:11.120
You have bad manners, little one.
You need to be taught a lesson.

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.960
That's how naughty little girls
get disciplined.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.480
-You're fast.
-You ain't seen nothing yet, girlie.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:28.200
In an open space like this,
I can do whatever I like.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:30.840
In your house, I wasn't at my best.

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:35.080
What a lousy excuse! Just because
you won't admit you were humiliated.

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:44.760
Listen, pipsqueak, every time
you disrespect me, you'll get a spanking.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.400
You'll get tired before me, you big dummy.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:53.600
Is that all you've got?

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.480
Okay, he's fat, but faster than me.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:14.360
On the other hand, it looks like
he needs a running start.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:17.400
You warming up yet?

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:20.000
Yeah, in this weather,
that's a good thing!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.680
Another one, then?

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:23.320
My pleasure.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.920
Well, you fat furball, how does that feel?

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.880
You little pest, you'll pay for that!

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:31.960
Okay, fine!
I won't treat you like a kid any more.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:34.080
It's about time, fatso!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.320
Elely!

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:18.720
What am I now?
An Iop who's no longer an Iop.

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:21.240
Not able to defend his own family.

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:29.120
Come on, Dally, you're better than this.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:33.120
We're in the same state,
good for nothing.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:35.400
Speak for yourself, Iop head.

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:10.240
What? This place...

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:13.120
No! Am I really dying?

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:17.760
Looks like it. It was bound to happen.
You're not a god anymore.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.480
Yeah, but no way! Not now of all times.

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:25.760
I can't leave Eva and the kids
to defend themselves.

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:32.120
Sometimes, we don't get to choose.
Nobody chooses when they go.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.000
That's life!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:40.120
Stop this madness, Rubi!
It can't end like this, not now!

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.400
Well, I wouldn't hold your breath.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:45.120
You saved me once, you can do it again!

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.560
First time was an accident.
I didn't know what I was doing.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:50.200
Don't forget I'm a Shushu.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:54.000
Okay, Rubi, cut to the chase
and tell me what you want!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.800
You know very well what I want, Iophead.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:02.280
A nice new sheath, maybe?
Or for me to sharpen you more often?

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:05.920
To think I once thought
you were less of an Iop than you looked.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.120
Honestly, I don't know.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:13.280
My freedom, moron! I've been locked up
in this sword prison for years.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:16.520
Let's make a new pact.
I help you, and you free me.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.520
I'm your guardian,
I'm not allowed to free you.

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:23.240
If you'd rather claim your place
in one-armed Iop heaven...

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.880
Rubi, after all
we've been through together,

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:28.960
you wouldn't let me go like this!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.440
Is that it?
Is the spanking really over already?

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:40.040
You asked for it.

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:17.520
An Iop should know how to use her head!
The first thing my dad taught me!

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:28.360
I thought you were a little pest,
now I'm sure of it!

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.240
A sneaky little pest.

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:38.880
I see why Adamai is so intent
on you joining the brotherhood.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:41.040
You'll make an excellent Iop goddess.

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:44.520
You said, Iop goddess? Yeah, whatever.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.240
I wasn't dreaming.

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:53.280
It really happened.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:57.160
-Do you really think that Adamai did this?
-I saw him, Ruel.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.360
Over there.

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:17.800
Did they fall down there?
Nobody could survive a fall like that.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.120
Dally isn't just anyone, Amalia.

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:46.640
Okay. That's it, then, I'm not dead.
Now I just have to find my daughter.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.600
Huh? What the heck is that?

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:56.240
You can't knock that Pandawa
around without your favorite arm.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:01.320
-Rubi, this... this is great!
-You ain't seen nothing yet.

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:04.280
You can transform it
into any shape you like.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:06.960
Since we're connected now,
just let me know.

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:19.040
But it's no excuse to be an idiot!

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:29.040
Rubi, this is better than great, it's...

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:30.520
Superb?

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.480
-Is that better than great?
-Yeah!

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:34.160
It's superb, then!

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:37.800
Just don't forget our deal.
I help you and I'm free.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:39.600
A promise is a promise, Rubi.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:57.200
Elely!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:03.120
-Papa? Are you done napping?
-I'm coming, sweetie. I'll take care of...

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:06.160
Forget it!
You are going to let me finish my fight.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:10.480
-You look like you're in bad shape.
-Well, look at him!

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:14.000
Sir Percedal? I thought you were dead.

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:17.520
We Sadlygroves are hard to get rid of.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:23.040
Okay, but finish him off quickly.
We need to find your mom and brother.

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:27.520
Finish me off?
Did you fall on your head...?

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.920
Look, Papa!
My hands are too small to punch him!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.560
I'm doing what you said
and using my head.

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:46.000
Okay, make sure you use your forehead,
or you'll hurt yourself.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:51.240
-Like this?
-All right!

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:54.600
I... I've had enough. I... I give up.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:58.840
What do you mean, you give up?
Is he allowed to do that, Papa?

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:02.360
Well, it's rare. He's a wimp, that's all.

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:05.360
Is that a victory for me,
or do I need to off him?

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:09.280
It counts as a victory!
And we don't off people in this family.

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.760
Yeah, except he deserves it.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:16.160
You can't be serious. Sir Percedal!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:21.240
You need to settle this one yourselves.
I'm still not strong enough to stop her.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:35.160
Dally!

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:37.960
I thought you were dead!

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:43.120
Whoops! Sorry. Wait, are... you crying?

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.160
With pride, Yugo.

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:51.080
I just watched my daughter
win her first fight.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:03.800
Dally!

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:13.400
But... did you got your arm back?

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:16.640
Sure did, I made a pact with Rubi
just before I died.

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:20.120
He helps me find Eva and Flopin,
and I free him.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:24.480
Hold on, you mean he actually saved you
in exchange for his freedom?

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:25.960
Exactly!

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:30.320
Dally, you do know
that when a guardian dies,

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:32.800
his Shushu is finally freed, right?

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:34.920
Yeah, so what?

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.080
Oh, uh... No, it's nothing.

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:41.480
Rubilax only saved you
because he's a big ol' Shushu softie!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:45.160
Open your trap again, Grandpa,
and I'll show you how soft I am.

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:47.240
Oh... I'll be quiet.

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:51.320
Dally, was it really Adamai
who attacked you?

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:58.480
He was unrecognizable,
physically and "montally..."

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:02.320
"Metally..." What I'm trying to say is,
he wasn't in his right mind.

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:11.920
Fortunately, we've got someone here
who can tell us how to find my brother.

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:18.000
It's no use threatening me, Yugo.
I won't tell you a thing.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:21.680
No need for your life story.
We've heard quite enough from you!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:38.920
Just what we were looking for.
Recall potions.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.640
These are going to take us
where we need to go.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:46.120
I need one to get back.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:53.400
Count yourself lucky you're getting off
easy. Ready for the next chapter, sweetie?

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:56.560
Fists will fly, Papa.
Let's knock some teeth out!

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:03.880
Are you ready to face Adamai
after what he did?

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.960
There has to be a reason, Amalia.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:12.880
I know Ad and I can't believe he'd attack
Dally and Eva unless he was forced to.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.800
Someone's got to be pulling the strings.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:25.680
We'll need to watch over him again,
Amalia.

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:30.920
Let's go.

